---
/**
 * Visual Direction: Exclusive Dining Experiences.
 * Staggered photo cards with Chilli or Lavender outlines overlapping the giant headline,
 * short paragraph, and "View Our Gallery" button.
 */
---
<section class="py-20 sm:py-28 bg-charcoal text-cream overflow-hidden border-t border-b border-white/10" aria-labelledby="exclusive-dining-heading">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 items-center">
      
      {/* Left Column: Giant Headline & Copy */}
      <div class="lg:col-span-6 flex flex-col gap-6 z-10">
        <span class="text-xs uppercase font-extrabold tracking-widest text-lemon font-mono">
          ◆ Intimate & Unhurried
        </span>

        <h2 id="exclusive-dining-heading" class="font-display text-4xl sm:text-6xl text-cream font-normal leading-[1.05] text-balance">
          Exclusive Dining <br />
          <span class="text-lemon italic font-serif">Experiences</span> in Lekki.
        </h2>

        <p class="text-cream/80 text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed max-w-xl">
          Whether it’s private tasting menus, weekend live charcoal grills under ambient Edison lights, or an intimate booth for two, Zesti Kitchen pairs fire-cooked flavours with warm Lagos hospitality.
        </p>

        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4 pt-4">
          <a
            href="/gallery"
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-6 py-3.5 rounded-full bg-cream text-charcoal hover:bg-lemon transition-colors font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-wider focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-lemon min-h-[44px]"
          >
            <span>View Our Gallery</span>
            <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
          </a>

          <a
            href="/reserve"
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-6 py-3.5 rounded-full border border-cream/30 text-cream hover:bg-white/10 transition-colors font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-wider focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-white min-h-[44px]"
          >
            <span>Reserve a Table</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      {/* Right Column: Staggered Photo Cards with Chilli and Lavender outlines */}
      <div class="lg:col-span-6 relative flex justify-center items-center">
        <div class="relative w-full max-w-lg h-[420px] sm:h-[480px]">
          
          {/* Card 1: Warm Steam & Sauce Pour shot (Chilli outline) */}
          <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-3/5 aspect-[4/5] rounded-squircle overflow-hidden shadow-2xl border-4 border-chilli transform -rotate-3 hover:rotate-0 transition-transform duration-300 z-10 group">
            <img
              src="/images/scene-sauce-pour.webp"
              alt="Live peppered sauce pour over flame-grilled chops"
              width="480"
              height="600"
              loading="lazy"
              class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500"
              onerror="this.onerror=null; this.src='/images/placeholder-dish.svg';"
            />
            <div class="absolute bottom-3 left-3 bg-charcoal/80 backdrop-blur-sm text-cream px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-[11px] font-mono">
              Live Fire Grill
            </div>
          </div>

          {/* Card 2: Artisanal Plating & Wine (Lavender outline) */}
          <div class="absolute bottom-2 right-0 w-3/5 aspect-[4/5] rounded-squircle overflow-hidden shadow-2xl border-4 border-lavender-electric transform rotate-4 hover:rotate-0 transition-transform duration-300 z-20 group">
            <img
              src="/images/scene-steam-suya.webp"
              alt="Steaming hot suya platter with freshly chopped garnish"
              width="480"
              height="600"
              loading="lazy"
              class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500"
              onerror="this.onerror=null; this.src='/images/placeholder-dish.svg';"
            />
            <div class="absolute bottom-3 right-3 bg-charcoal/80 backdrop-blur-sm text-lemon px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-[11px] font-mono">
              Private Dining
            </div>
          </div>

          {/* Floating accent badge */}
          <div class="absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 z-30 bg-lemon text-charcoal rounded-full px-4 py-2 shadow-2xl font-display font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-wider border-2 border-charcoal">
            Chef Tasting Table
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

